 "code": "def rotate(matrix: list[list[int]]) -> list[list[int]]:\n    n = len(matrix)\n    # 1. Transpose across the main diagonal (only swap each pair once).\n    for r in range(n):\n        for c in range(r + 1, n):\n            matrix[r][c], matrix[c][r] = matrix[c][r], matrix[r][c]\n    # 2. Reverse every row.\n    for row in matrix:\n        row.reverse()\n    return matrix\n",
